---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Sponsors | Synapse Engine">
    <main class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20">
        
        <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-24">
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white mb-6 leading-tight">
                Fund the Future of <br>
                <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-400 to-pink-500">Open-Source Graphics</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">
                The Synapse Engine is a research-oriented, high-performance rendering framework built with C++23 and modern Vulkan. 
                My mission is to translate complex, enterprise-grade architecture into accessible, high-quality, and completely free educational content.
            </p>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
                By sponsoring this project, you are funding the research, the devblogs, and the time required to develop this engine full-time. 
                Knowledge should be free. You can help keep it that way.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-20">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-8 text-center">Monthly Sponsorship Tiers</h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
                
                <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-purple-500/50 rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-[0_0_20px_-10px_rgba(168,85,247,0.3)] relative flex flex-col transform lg:-translate-y-2">
                    <div class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-500 to-pink-500 text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">Highly Appreciated</div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">The Meshlet Supporter</h3>
                    <div class="text-3xl font-black text-purple-400 mb-4">$4 <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-500">/ month</span></div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-8 flex-1">
                        A foundational contribution. Your support directly assists in the continuous research and publication of free educational materials.
                    </p>
                    <a href="https://github.com/sponsors/TamasPetii" target="_blank" class="block w-full py-3 text-center rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-pink-600 hover:from-purple-500 hover:to-pink-500 text-white font-bold transition-colors">Select Tier</a>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-gray-700 transition-colors flex flex-col">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">The ECS Backer</h3>
                    <div class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-4">$12 <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-500">/ month</span></div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-8 flex-1">
                        A significant contribution. This helps fund the infrastructure for benchmarking advanced data-oriented architectures.
                    </p>
                    <a href="https://github.com/sponsors/TamasPetii" target="_blank" class="block w-full py-3 text-center rounded-lg bg-gray-800 hover:bg-gray-700 text-white font-medium transition-colors">Select Tier</a>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-gray-700 transition-colors flex flex-col">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">The Forward+ Sponsor</h3>
                    <div class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-4">$29 <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-500">/ month</span></div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-8 flex-1">
                        A major investment. Your support allows me to dedicate the required hours to author comprehensive technical tutorials.
                    </p>
                    <a href="https://github.com/sponsors/TamasPetii" target="_blank" class="block w-full py-3 text-center rounded-lg bg-gray-800 hover:bg-gray-700 text-white font-medium transition-colors">Select Tier</a>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-gray-700 transition-colors flex flex-col">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">The GPU-Driven Patron</h3>
                    <div class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-4">$99 <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-500">/ month</span></div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-8 flex-1">
                        For organizations or dedicated professionals ensuring the long-term, full-time development of the engine.
                    </p>
                    <a href="https://github.com/sponsors/TamasPetii" target="_blank" class="block w-full py-3 text-center rounded-lg bg-gray-800 hover:bg-gray-700 text-white font-medium transition-colors">Select Tier</a>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-24">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-8 text-center">One-Time Support</h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                
                <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-gray-700 transition-colors flex flex-col">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Research Supporter</h3>
                    <div class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-4">$5 <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-500">/ one-time</span></div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-8 flex-1">
                        A direct contribution to the ongoing research. Ideal if you found a specific research paper or code implementation valuable.
                    </p>
                    <a href="https://github.com/sponsors/TamasPetii" target="_blank" class="block w-full py-3 text-center rounded-lg bg-gray-800 hover:bg-gray-700 text-white font-medium transition-colors">Support Once</a>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-gray-700 transition-colors flex flex-col">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Publication Catalyst</h3>
                    <div class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-4">$25 <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-500">/ one-time</span></div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-8 flex-1">
                        A substantial contribution supporting the time-intensive process of translating complex rendering techniques into educational content.
                    </p>
                    <a href="https://github.com/sponsors/TamasPetii" target="_blank" class="block w-full py-3 text-center rounded-lg bg-gray-800 hover:bg-gray-700 text-white font-medium transition-colors">Support Once</a>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-gray-700 transition-colors flex flex-col">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Architecture Patron</h3>
                    <div class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-4">$100 <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-500">/ one-time</span></div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-8 flex-1">
                        A massive endorsement of the core mission. Heavily supports the continuous R&D required to build a custom engine architecture.
                    </p>
                    <a href="https://github.com/sponsors/TamasPetii" target="_blank" class="block w-full py-3 text-center rounded-lg bg-gray-800 hover:bg-gray-700 text-white font-medium transition-colors">Support Once</a>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-gray-800 pt-20 text-center">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Wall of Fame</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-400 mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                A massive thank you to the incredible individuals and organizations making this open-source journey possible.
            </p>
            
            <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center p-8 border border-dashed border-gray-700 rounded-2xl bg-gray-900/50">
                <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-medium">Be the first legend to appear on the Wall of Fame!</p>
            </div>
        </div>

    </main>
</Layout>